OL,3,AUK long-term borrowing costs hit
OL,4,Ahighest since 2008 ahead of October
OL,5,ABudget
OL,6,
OL,7,FLong-term government borrowing costs
OL,8,Fhave risen to a 28-year high, putting
OL,9,Ffurther pressure on Prime Minister Andy
OL,10,FBurnham ahead of his first Budget next
OL,11,Fmonth.
OL,13,FThe yield on a 30-year gilt ` a loan to
OL,14,Fthe British government ` rose to 5.89%,
OL,15,Fthe highest since 1998.
OL,17,FThe effective cost of borrowing for
OL,18,Fgovernments across the globe has
OL,19,Fcontinued to rise this morning with new
OL,20,Fmulti-decade highs in market interest
OL,21,Frates.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
