OL,3,AUK long-term borrowing costs hit
OL,4,Ahighest since 2008 ahead of October
OL,5,ABudget
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe moves reflect concerns about
OL,8,Finflation arising from the ongoing Iran
OL,9,Fwar, competition from major tech firms
OL,10,Ffor long-term borrowing, and concerns
OL,11,Fabout state borrowing levels.
